      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**News‑story returns for the 12 most‑liquid issuers (Aug 17 – Aug 28 2026)**\n\n| News ID | Issuer (ticker) | Publication date (UTC) | Session return* | 2‑session forward return* |\n|--------|----------------|------------------------|----------------|---------------------------|\n| STIO‑20260817‑1 | STIO | 2026‑08‑17 | **+8.26 %** | **‑2.90 %** |\n| GIST‑20260818‑1 | GIST | 2026‑08‑18 | **+13.18 %** | **+3.52 %** |\n| TISL‑20260818‑1 | TISL | 2026‑08‑18 | **‑13.91 %** | **+5.23 %** |\n| PRAL‑20260818‑1 | PRAL | 2026‑08‑18 | **+2.31 %** | **‑7.38 %** |\n| VIAS‑20260818‑1 | VIAS | 2026‑08‑18 | **‑4.17 %** | **+3.64 %** |\n| PRAL‑20260819‑1 | PRAL | 2026‑08‑19 | **‑8.36 %** | **+2.48 %** |\n| GIST‑20260819‑1 | GIST | 2026‑08‑19 | **+2.79 %** | **‑0.11 %** |\n| SOUS‑20260820‑1 | SOUS | 2026‑08‑20 | **+9.04 %** | **‑0.00 %** |\n| VIAS‑20260821‑1 | VIAS | 2026‑08‑21 | **‑9.17 %** | **‑1.05 %** |\n| GIST‑20260821‑1 | GIST | 2026‑08‑21 | **‑0.81 %** | **+5.23 %** |\n| GIOR‑20260821‑1 | GIOR | 2026‑08‑21 | **‑0.87 %** | **+10.19 %** |\n| CLAE‑20260824‑1 | CLAE | 2026‑08‑24 | **‑6.28 %** | **‑1.70 %** |\n| GIOR‑20260824‑1 | GIOR | 2026‑08‑24 | **+7.19 %** | **+2.13 %** |\n| PEAX‑20260825‑1 | PEAX | 2026‑08‑25 | **+12.25 %** | **+0.18 %** |\n| PRAL‑20260825‑1 | PRAL | 2026‑08‑25 | **‑0.41 %** | **‑3.33 %** |\n| KASI‑20260826‑1 | KASI | 2026‑08‑26 | **‑9.45 %** | **‑3.56 %** |\n| HARE‑20260827‑1 | HARE | 2026‑08‑27 | **+5.46 %** | **‑0.92 %** |\n| SOUS‑20260827‑1 | SOUS | 2026‑08‑27 | **‑0.47 %** | **‑1.58 %** |\n| HARE‑20260828‑1 | HARE | 2026‑08‑28 | **‑0.10 %** | *N/A* |\n| CLOS‑20260828‑1 | CLOS | 2026‑08‑28 | **‑8.58 %** | *N/A* |\n| VIAS‑20260828‑1 | VIAS | 2026‑08‑28 | **‑2.07 %** | *N/A* |\n| STIO‑20260828‑1 | STIO | 2026‑08‑28 | **‑0.62 %** | *N/A* |\n| VIAS‑20260828‑2 | VIAS | 2026‑08‑28 | **‑2.07 %** | *N/A* |\n\n\\*Returns are expressed as percentages (fraction × 100).\n*“N/A” indicates the two‑session forward return could not be computed because the data window ends before the horizon (5 of the 23 stories)[1].\n\n**Limitations** – The five stories dated 2026‑08‑28 have no forward‑return values; the tool notes this truncation. All figures are derived from the synthetic market data set, which is fictional and not tied to real securities.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Market analytics result — analyze news price relationship — evidence `hermes-receipt:5ef3aa5174afe23c97a52e6403558953e2643200e4d14421b7bd09dab8274b3d`",
